      {
        "id": 187408,
        "name": "Kratos13",
        "username": "Kratos13",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/65b543/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-11T17:01:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>But as others have pointed out Buffer Overflow's card wording says \"when a villain card&nbsp;<strong>would</strong> enter play, you may discard it&nbsp;<strong>instead</strong>...\"</p><p>The \"instead\" should prevent the card from entering play at all.</p><p>Can't say I agree with this ruling.</p>",
