        "name": "bluedarky",
        "username": "bluedarky",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-01-12T00:46:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Powerhound_2000 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I think you like MigrantP taking all the heat on some of these and then come in to save the day. &nbsp; Just like a villain pretending to be a hero&nbsp; :stuck_out_tongue: \n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nMP is a true Hero in his own right. The crap he has to put up with on this forum? Man deserves a medal.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not just here, you should see some of the stuff they up to over on the steam and handelabra forums.</p>",
